      <cyrillic>ивлэгэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>IBILGE-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. caus of ibil-] To cause a cow to release her milk; to cause the flow of milk before milking ( e. g. by letting the-young suck); to wheedle something out of a person, milk someone.</definition>
